    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "44d6b342-296a-427c-9964-bf1cf45e44ee",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Stars Align",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MARRAKECH",
        "PublicId": "106434417328",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_spider.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6f862816-5107-44b0-a0f8-cd3c88178c22).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47,\rAfter what we recovered in Colombia, we have traced Orion to Marrakesh, Morocco where he is going under the alias of Irshaad Ismail. He is leading the propagandists of General Zaydan. However, due to Orion&apos;s connection with Zaydan, we must also also eliminate Hanif Rasmi Antoun - his contact with the military. The client also request we eliminate the target disguised as rebel soldiers, to make it seem as though the kills were by request of Zaydan.\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
